.SH "Typedef Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "typedef int(* t_builtin_fn) (struct s_shell *shell, int argc, char **argv)"

.PP
Builtin function type\&. 
.PP
.RS 4
Forward declaration to avoid circular dependency with \fB42sh\&.h\fP 
.RE
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIshell\fP Pointer to the central shell state, for accessing variables, jobs, etc\&. 
.br
\fIargc\fP Argument count (number of elements in argv) 
.br
\fIargv\fP Argument vector (array of strings, with argv[0] being the command name) 
.RE
.PP
