.SS "int builtin_history (struct s_shell * shell, int argc, char ** argv)"

.PP
display the command history list This function displays the command history list in a format similar to bash and ksh\&.

.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIshell\fP The shell context (not used in this function)\&. 
.br
\fIargc\fP The number of arguments passed to the history command\&. 
.br
\fIargv\fP The arguments passed to the history command\&. If a numeric argument is provided, it specifies how many of the most recent entries to display\&.
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
int Always returns 0\&. 
.RE
.PP

